        "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:28:45.167Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, a rando bad hunter can just annoy anyone else in a given area, whether it’s players living there and doing their normal activities or hunters trying to find something worthwhile to shoot or camp an area to deny locals space usage?</p>\n<p>Sounds like a fantastic idea. <img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/2X/5/5cef807c35b9ea0163a2a5659715a7ac34f447f0.jpg?v=14\" title=\":facepalm:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":facepalm:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
